export anchor DarkIconRailStyle:
    number: 229
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Dark icon rail
    idea: A dense three-pane dark work surface, with a near-black icon rail, a list pane holding the greeting, figures and projects, and a wider detail pane with Mobile app 2.0 open, stepped in cool greys with one violet accent.
    base: dark
    palette:
        rail: #0b0c10, the 60px icon rail
        listPane: #14161c, the list pane, fields and the style sheet
        detailPane: #1a1d24, the detail pane and its top bar
        card: #21252e, cards and the facts strip
        line: #2e333d, borders, dividers and meter tracks
        ink: #e4e6ec, text
        muted: #9ea4b2, meta, labels and axis text
        railInk: #9aa0ad, rail icons that are not current
        violet: #b49cff, the primary button, the selected edge, meters, this week bars, tags and focus
        onViolet: #1b1036, text on violet
        selected: #2a2440, the selected project row and the current rail item
        lastWeek: #7a8192, outlined last week bars
        ok: #7fd8a6, the outlined On track tag
        risk: #f3c56a, the outlined At risk tag
        bad: #ff9a8f, the outlined Behind tag and the overdue line
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Ubuntu. Base 13px at
        1.45. The detail title is 24px at 650, the greeting 18px at 650,
        figures 20px at 650 with tabular numbers, pane labels 11px caps
        tracked 0.08em, tags 11.5px at 650.
    layout:
        Three columns at full height. The 60px rail holds a violet B tile,
        six icon-only links with names and tooltips, Home on a violet tinted
        tile with a 3px violet edge bar, and the MO disc at the foot. The
        340px list pane holds the date, Good morning, Mara, a red clock line
        reading 4 tasks are overdue, the four figures as a two by two grid
        split by 1px lines, then a Projects label with the count and six
        rows. Each row has the name, an outlined status tag, category and
        due date, and a 3px meter with percent and done over total. Mobile
        app 2.0 is selected with a violet tint and a violet left edge. The
        detail pane has a top bar with search and a slash key hint, New
        project, a bell and Mara Okafor. Below sit a breadcrumb Projects,
        Engineering, Mobile app 2.0, the 24px title with its At risk tag and
        an Open project button, the line Engineering · due 2 Dec, 32 days
        left, a four-cell facts strip for progress, tasks done, due and
        status, then two cards side by side. The chart card shows last week
        as outlined bars and this week as solid violet. The Team activity
        card tags the two items about Mobile app 2.0 with This project.
        Below 1180px the cards stack. Below 860px the rail becomes a sticky
        top row, and the top bar, the list pane and the detail follow in
        that order.
    spacing: An 8px unit, tight. 16 to 20px pane padding, 9px row padding, 14px between cards.
    density: Dense. Three panes at once, a 13px body and small figures.
    corners: 6px panes, cards and buttons, 8px rail tiles, 4px tags, round avatars.
    borders: 1px #2e333d between panes, rows and cells. A 3px violet edge on the selected row and the current rail item.
    shadows: None. Panes separate by four stepped greys from #0b0c10 to #21252e.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.75 stroke, 16px, and 20px in the rail. Status tags
        are outlined in the status colour with a check circle, a triangle or
        a crossed square and the word.
    focus: A 2px violet outline offset 2px.
    tone: Plain and neutral, such as Team activity, Tasks completed, Open project and This project.
